    "spike": {
      "summary": [
        "Jump, charge contact, then release while pointing the cursor across the net.",
        "Contact near the jump apex gives full power; approach direction and the third team touch can add power.",
        "Left/right aerial tilt curves the shot; forward tilt gives a flatter faster attack and backward tilt gives a softer higher one."
      ],
