    "block": {
      "summary": [
        "Jump first, then hold the block input at the right moment while facing the attacker.",
        "Timing and cursor direction affect the rebound. Late blocks are less controlled.",
        "The centre of the hands can stop a ball sharply; edge contacts may be tooled."
      ],
