      "summary": [
        "Shift strafing cancels horizontal momentum and keeps the character facing the cursor.",
        "Ctrl or a double-tapped movement direction sprints and uses stamina.",
        "A short jump tap gives a small jump; charge and release for more height. Holding too long causes decay."
      ],
